UnitASPRegistry::constructor
├── When access router is invalid
│   └── It should revert with Permissioned_InvalidAccessRouter
└── When called
    └── it sets the access router

UnitASPRegistry::initialize
├── When called on the implementation
│   └── It should revert with InvalidInitialization, since the constructor disabled initializers
├── When called a second time
│   └── It should revert with InvalidInitialization
└── When called for the first time
    └── It should keep the address router from the verifier

UnitASPRegistry::_authorizeUpgrade
├── When caller does not have UPGRADER_ROLE in accessRouter
│   ├── It should query access router for the upgrader role
│   └── It should revert with InvalidUpgrader
└── When caller has UPGRADER_ROLE in access router
    ├── It should query access router for the upgrader role
    └── It should succeed

UnitASPRegistry::latestASPRoot
├── When associationSets is empty
│   └── It should revert with ASPRegistry_EmptyAssociationSet
├── When association set has one element
│   └── It should return said element
└── When association set has many elements
    └── It should return the last one

UnitASPRegistry::latestIPFSCID
├── When associationSets is empty
│   └── It should revert with ASPRegistry_EmptyAssociationSet
├── When association set has one element
│   └── It should return said element
└── When association set has many elements
    └── It should return the last one

UnitASPRegistry::associationSets
├── When called on a non-existant index
│   └── It should revert with an out of bounds panic
└── When called on a valid index
    └── It should return the set value

UnitASPRegistry::updateASPRoot
├── When caller does not have POSTMAN_ROLE
│   └── It should revert with UnauthorizedPostmen
├── When root is zero
│   └── It should revert with ASPRegistry_EmptyASPRoot
├── When root is out of field
│   └── It should revert with ASPRegistry_RootOutOfField
├── When ipfsCID is zero
│   └── It should revert with ASPRegistry_EmptyIPFSCID
└── When preconditions are met
    ├── It queries the accessRouter for the role of the caller
    ├── It inserts the root and ipfsCID into the associationSets array
    └── It emits an ASPRootUpdated event

UnitASPRegistry::registerLabel
└── When called
    └── It should emit a LabelRegistered event

